==================================================
1. PRODUCT GOAL
==================================================

This application is a Gym Owner Operating Dashboard.

The primary goal is:

"Give a gym owner one place where they can understand the health of their gym and complete important daily tasks quickly."

The owner should immediately be able to see:

- Total members
- Active members
- Expiring memberships
- Expired memberships
- New members
- Revenue
- Pending payments
- Today's attendance
- Upcoming renewals
- Birthdays
- Important actions
- Recent activity

The dashboard should prioritize ACTIONS over vanity statistics.

