37. DASHBOARD CALCULATIONS
==================================================

Do not hard-code dashboard statistics.

Calculate from database.

Total Members:
count all non-archived members.

Active Members:
members with active membership.

Expiring Soon:
membership expiry within next 7 days.

Expired:
membership expiry before today.

Revenue:
sum successful payments.

New Members:
members created within selected period.

Pending Payments:
payments with pending status.

Birthdays Today:
members whose date_of_birth matches today's month/day.

Renewals:
memberships approaching expiry.

==================================================
38. AUTOMATIC MEMBERSHIP STATUS
==================================================

Membership status should be derived intelligently.

If:

end_date < today:
Expired

If:

end_date <= today + 7 days:
Expiring

Otherwise:
Active

Do not require the owner to manually update status every day.

